00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A capacitor in series with R charges with time constant τ = R × C; in sinusoidal AC, V_peak = V_rms × √2 (e.g. 230 V RMS peaks at about 325 V, and in Colombia 120 V RMS reaches about 170 V peak).

